{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36574","headline":"雪 · 罗隐","name":"雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"细玉罗纹下碧霄，杜门颜巷落偏饶。\n巢居只恐高柯折，旅客愁闻去路遥。\n撅冻野蔬和粉重，埽庭松叶带酥烧。\n寒窗呵笔寻诗句，一片飞来纸上销。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36574.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36574","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}